@startuml schema
title GitLab CI/CD: Antora + GitLab Pages + PDF

start
:Developer pushes to main;
:CI job build_site runs;
fork
  :Ruby scripts generate PDF from .adoc;
  :Copy PDF to attachments/;
end fork
:Antora outputs site into public/ (including attachments/);
:Save public/ as job artifact;
:GitLab Pages publishes site from artifact;
stop
@enduml